"OTs-14\" loading=\"lazy\">OTs-14</a>&nbsp;</b><p>• Team Băng mới cùng Doll tương lai:&nbsp;<a class=\"guide-inline-ref guide-inline-character\" title=\"Alva\" href=\"../characters/alva.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img class=\"guide-inline-icon\" src=\"../assets/images/characters/alva/avatar.png\" alt=\"Alva\" loading=\"lazy\">Alva</a>&nbsp;+&nbsp;<a class=\"guide-inline-ref guide-inline-character\" title=\"Robella\" href=\"../characters/robella.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img class=\"guide-inline-icon\" src=\"../assets/images/characters/robella/avatar.png\" alt=\"Robella\" loading=\"lazy\">Robella</a>&nbsp;/&nbsp;<a class=\"guide-inline-ref guide-inline-character\" title=\"Dushevnaya\" href=\"../characters/dushevnaya.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img class=\"guide-inline-icon\" src=\"../assets/images/characters/dushevnaya/avatar.png\" alt=\"Dushevnaya\" loading=\"lazy\">Dushevnaya</a>&nbsp;/&nbsp;<a class=\"guide-inline-ref guide-inline-character\" title=\"Loreley\" href=\"../characters/loreley.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img class=\"guide-inline-icon\" src=\"../assets/images/characters/loreley/avatar.png\" alt=\"Loreley\" loading=\"lazy\">Loreley</a>&nbsp;V2R1&nbsp;+&nbsp;<a class=\"guide-inline-ref guide-inline-character\" title=\"Soppo\" href=\"../characters/soppo.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img class=\"guide-inline-icon\" src=\"../assets/images/characters/soppo/avatar.png\" alt=\"Soppo\" loading=\"lazy\">Soppo</a>&nbsp;/ <a class=\"guide-inline-ref guide-inline-character\" title=\"Asteria\" href=\"../characters/asteria.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img class=\"guide-inline-icon\" src=\"../assets/images/characters/asteria/avatar.png\" alt=\"Asteria\" loading=\"lazy\">Asteria</a>&nbsp;+&nbsp;<a class=\"guide-inline-ref guide-inline-character\" title=\"OTs-14\" href=\"../characters/ots-14.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img class=\"guide-inline-icon\" src=\"../assets/images/characters/ots-14/avatar.png\" alt=\"OTs-14\" loading=\"lazy\">OTs-14</a></p>"
